---
// Hero Section - OPB Landing
---

<section id="inicio">
  <div class="hero-media"></div>

  <!-- Ruta marítima animada: se dibuja + señal viajando (estilo tracking en vivo) -->
  <svg class="hero-route" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path class="route-base" d="M30 340 C 190 320, 250 110, 575 60" pathLength="1"></path>
    <path class="route-line" d="M30 340 C 190 320, 250 110, 575 60" pathLength="1"></path>
    <path class="route-flow" d="M30 340 C 190 320, 250 110, 575 60" pathLength="1"></path>
    <circle class="route-port route-port-a" cx="30" cy="340" r="5"></circle>
    <circle class="route-port route-port-b" cx="575" cy="60" r="5"></circle>
  </svg>

  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy rv">
      <div class="eyebrow light">Temporada 2025-2026 · Reservas abiertas</div>
      <h1 class="h1-anim">
        <span class="word" style="--wi:0"><span>Conectamos</span></span>
        <span class="word" style="--wi:1"><span>Chile</span></span>
        <span class="word text-red" style="--wi:2"><span>con</span></span>
        <span class="word text-red" style="--wi:3"><span>el</span></span>
        <span class="word text-red" style="--wi:4"><span>mundo</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p>Logística naviera de clase mundial para exportación e importación de cargas refrigeradas, congeladas y especializadas. Integramos agenciamiento, transporte, documentación y visibilidad digital para que tu operación avance sin fricción.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">Cotizar mi embarque <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
        <a href="#servicios" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver nuestros servicios</a>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-row" aria-label="Indicadores de confianza">
        <span class="trust-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-ship"></i> +50 navieras</span>
        <span class="trust-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-temperature-half"></i> Cadena de frío</span>
        <span class="trust-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> OPB 360°</span>
        <span class="trust-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i> Atención 24/7</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-panel rv d2" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="control-card">
        <div class="panel-inner">
          <div class="panel-top">
            <div class="panel-title"><span class="pulse-dot"></span><div><strong>Torre de Control OPB</strong><span>Tracking activo en tiempo real</span></div></div>
            <span class="live-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-signal"></i> Live</span>
          </div>
          <div class="route">
            <div class="port"><span>Origen</span><strong>San Antonio</strong></div>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
            <div class="port" style="text-align:right"><span>Destino</span><strong>Rotterdam</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-block">
            <div class="progress-head"><span>Tránsito marítimo</span><span>67% completado</span></div>
            <div class="progress-line"><span id="progress-fill"></span></div>
            <div class="progress-head"><span>ETD 22 Ene</span><span>ETA 09 Feb</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ship-list">
            <div class="ship-item"><div><strong>Booking #6735 · HAPAG</strong><small>Contenedor 40 RHC · 42 pallets</small></div><span class="status ok">En ruta</span></div>
            <div class="ship-item"><div><strong>Control documental</strong><small>B/L · Fitosanitario · DUS</small></div><span class="status ok">Completo</span></div>
            <div class="ship-item"><div><strong>Transporte terrestre</strong><small>Depósito → Planta → Puerto</small></div><span class="status info">Stacking OK</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i><strong>92%</strong><span>Cumplimiento de planificación</span></div>
      <div class="floating-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell"></i> Alertas automáticas a clientes</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stats-strip">
  <div class="stats-shell">
    <div class="stat"><strong data-count="25" data-suffix="+">25<span>+</span></strong><p>Años de experiencia del equipo naviero</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong data-count="50" data-suffix="+">50<span>+</span></strong><p>Navieras con alianza directa</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong data-count="3">3</strong><p>Oficinas en Chile: Concón, Santiago y Valparaíso</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong data-count="24" data-suffix="/7">24<span>/7</span></strong><p>Atención dedicada en temporada</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
